---
export const prerender = true;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Prompt Engineering - One Page Guide</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.3; color: #e0e0e0; background: #1a1a1a; }
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0.4in; }
        @media print { body { background: #1a1a1a; } .container { background: #1a1a1a; color: #e0e0e0; } }
        .container { background: #1a1a1a; padding: 0.4in; max-width: 8.5in; height: 11in; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.08in; }
        h1 { font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 0.08in; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; }
        h2 { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.06in; color: #fff; margin-top: 0.06in; }
        p { font-size: 9px; margin-bottom: 0.015in; line-height: 1.3; }
        table { width: 100%; font-size: 8.5px; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 0.04in 0; }
        th { text-align: left; padding: 0.04in; border-bottom: 1px solid #444; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
        td { padding: 0.03in; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }
        .code { background: #0d0d0d; padding: 0.05in; border-left: 2px solid #4a9eff; font-family: 'Monaco', monospace; font-size: 7.5px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0.03in 0; color: #d4d4d4; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word; }
        .pattern { font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
        .anti { color: #ff6b6b; }
        ul { margin-left: 0.1in; margin-bottom: 0.04in; }
        li { margin-bottom: 0.01in; font-size: 9px; }
        .formula { text-align: center; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; background: #0d0d0d; padding: 0.03in; margin: 0.03in 0; font-size: 8px; color: #d4d4d4; }
        .footer { font-size: 7px; color: #666; text-align: center; margin-top: auto; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Prompt Engineering</h1>

        <div>
            <h2>The core patterns</h2>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 18%;">Pattern</th>
                    <th style="width: 42%;">When to use it</th>
                    <th>Shape</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">Zero-shot</span></td>
                    <td>Simple, well-defined tasks</td>
                    <td>Just ask.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">Few-shot</span></td>
                    <td>Output format is strict</td>
                    <td>Show 2–5 examples first.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">Chain-of-Thought</span></td>
                    <td>Reasoning, math, planning</td>
                    <td>"Think step by step"</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">ReAct</span></td>
                    <td>Agent / tool-using flows</td>
                    <td>Thought → Action → Observation</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">Self-consistency</span></td>
                    <td>High-stakes reasoning</td>
                    <td>Sample n completions, take majority.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="pattern">Reflection</span></td>
                    <td>Improving prior output</td>
                    <td>Ask model to critique & revise.</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2>A reusable template</h2>
            <div class="code"># Role
You are a &lt;role&gt; helping &lt;audience&gt; with &lt;task&gt;.

# Context
&lt;background – docs, constraints&gt;

# Task
&lt;exactly what you want it to do&gt;

# Output format
- Section 1: ...
- Return as JSON with keys: foo, bar, baz

# Rules
- Do not &lt;thing to avoid&gt;
- If unsure, say "I don't know"</div>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2>Anti-patterns (don't do this)</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><span class="anti">Stuffing prompt with every rule</span> → Keep it &lt; 400 tokens</li>
                <li><span class="anti">Using "Please" / "Thank you"</span> → Be direct</li>
                <li><span class="anti">Asking for JSON without schema</span> → Show an example</li>
                <li><span class="anti">Re-reading whole conversation</span> → Summarize & prune</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2>Quick math: Token cost</h2>
            <p>For a prompt of length <em>n</em> tokens, run <em>k</em> times with self-consistency:</p>
            <div class="formula">cost = k · (n · c<sub>in</sub> + m · c<sub>out</sub>)</div>
            <p><em>m</em> = average completion length. Useful for deciding if 10× sampling is worth it.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">AI Playbook Cheat Sheet | May 2026 | Print-friendly, one page</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
